### Straight-line over the total life: 15,000.00 / 5 = 3,000.00 a year
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/depreciation/calculate(Method='straight-line',Base=15000,Years=5)

### From the net book value over the remaining life: 500.00 / 5 = 100.00
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/depreciation/calculate(Method='remaining-life',Base=500,Years=5)

### Declining balance, factor 2, with the changeover
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/depreciation/calculate(Method='declining-balance',Base=15000,Years=5,Factor=2)

### An unknown method: rejected with HTTP 400
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/depreciation/calculate(Method='sum-of-digits',Base=15000,Years=5)

### The schedule of the delivery van, from its master record
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/depreciation/Assets('10001')/plan()
